---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/tools/operational-drag/"
title: "Operational Drag Scan"
description: "A free 12-question diagnostic that scores how much of your team's week goes into work that exists only because your systems don't talk to each other."
hasViz: true
hasAssessment: true
---
<section class="page-head wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--blue)"><a href="/tools/" style="color:inherit">Tools</a> &middot; Operations</p>
  <h1 class="display">Operational Drag Scan</h1>
  <p class="prose measure" style="font-size:1.2rem">{{ assessment.intro }}</p>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight wrap" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="measure prose">
    <p style="border-left:2px solid var(--blue);padding-left:1.5rem;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ink)">
      {{ assessment.context }}
    </p>
    <p>{{ assessment.instructions }}</p>
    <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-faint)">
      Nothing you enter leaves your browser. There is no submit endpoint, no cookie, and no email gate &mdash;
      you are being asked about your employer&rsquo;s dysfunction, so it shouldn&rsquo;t go anywhere.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<div data-assessment>
  <script type="application/json" id="assessment-config">{{ assessment | jsonify | safe }}</script>

  <section class="section section--tight wrap" style="padding-top:0">

    <div class="assess-progress no-print">
      <div class="assess-progress__track">
        <div class="assess-progress__fill" data-assessment-progress style="width:0%"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="assess-progress__text" data-assessment-progress-text aria-live="polite">0 of {{ assessment.questions | length }} answered</p>
    </div>

    <form data-assessment-form>
      {%- for cat in assessment.categories %}
      <fieldset class="assess-group">
        <legend class="assess-group__legend">
          <span class="assess-group__label">{{ cat.label }}</span>
          <span class="assess-group__desc">{{ cat.description }}</span>
        </legend>

        {%- for q in assessment.questions %}
        {%- if q.category == cat.key %}
        <div class="assess-q">
          <p class="assess-q__text" id="{{ q.id }}-label">{{ q.text }}</p>
          <div class="assess-q__scale" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="{{ q.id }}-label">
            {%- for opt in assessment.scale %}
            <label class="assess-opt">
              <input type="radio" name="{{ q.id }}" value="{{ opt.value }}">
              <span class="assess-opt__box">{{ opt.value }}</span>
              <span class="assess-opt__label">{{ opt.label }}</span>
            </label>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </fieldset>
      {%- endfor %}

      <div class="assess-actions no-print">
        <button class="btn btn--solid" type="submit" data-assessment-submit disabled>See my result</button>
        <button class="viz-table-toggle" type="button" data-assessment-reset>Start over</button>
      </div>
    </form>

    <div data-assessment-results hidden></div>
  </section>
</div>

<section class="band cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="headline">Want help removing it?</h2>
    <p class="prose measure" style="margin-inline:auto">This is the problem <a href="https://sinsa.ai" rel="noopener" target="_blank" style="color:#fff">SINSA</a> exists to solve &mdash; automating the boring middle rather than the customer-facing edge. Tell me what your result said.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem">
      <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/contact/" style="background:#fff;color:var(--blue)">Get in touch</a>
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a class="arrow-link" href="/tools/" style="color:#fff">All tools</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
